{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-units#card-zh","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-units","commit":"35a229e020816611567954554691d82ca657873d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-units 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的单位计算工具插件，会把四种工具注册到现有及新建的 Agent：convert_unit 执行同类别单位换算，list_units 查询类别与单位名称，unit_price 统一并比较商品单价，unit_sum 汇总带不同单位的数量并计算均值。实现覆盖长度、质量、温度、体积、数据大小与速率、燃油经济性等多种类别，并为温度和油耗处理非线性换算。适合需要让 Agent 准确处理测量、配方、数据容量和价格比较的场景。使用无需 API key 或外部服务，显示精度可通过 maxDecimals 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:76-90","src/tools.ts:69-81","src/tools.ts:159-167","src/units.ts:852"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-units#card-en","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-units","commit":"35a229e020816611567954554691d82ca657873d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-units gives DeepSeek Harness agents four tools: convert units, list supported units, compare prices, and sum mixed-unit quantities. It handles measurement, data-size, temperature, and fuel-economy conversions. No API key or external service is needed; display precision is configurable.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:76-90","src/tools.ts:69-81","src/tools.ts:159-167","src/units.ts:852"]}
